sequenceDiagram
    actor Tester
    participant UI as React web / planned mobile
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    actor Member
    Tester->>UI: Choose a build or open session and submit feedback
    UI->>API: POST /api/playtest-feedback with bearer token
    API->>DB: Verify user, project, build and session
    alt Invalid token or closed/expired session
      API-->>UI: 401 or 400; retain entered feedback
    else Valid submission
      API->>DB: Insert feedback with server author and timestamp
      API->>DB: Record activity and recipient notifications (best effort)
      API-->>UI: 201; show persisted feedback
      Member->>UI: Open feedback and mark reviewed or log bug
      UI->>API: PATCH feedback / POST bug report
      API->>DB: Check team membership and same-project references
      API->>DB: Persist review or linked bug
      API-->>UI: Updated record
    end
    Note over UI,API: Separate mobile implementation remains unverified
